    "result_text": "Full suite is green (25 tests, 0 failures). \n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the `membershipTier` field: **SILVER** when `namesakeCount` is 0 and an email is present, otherwise **BRONZE**.\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipTier` string property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto` that derives the tier from the already-persisted `namesakeCount` and `email`:\n   ```\n   SILVER  iff namesakeCount != null && namesakeCount == 0 && email present (non-blank)\n   BRONZE  otherwise\n   ```\n\nI computed it in the mapper rather than as a pipeline step because the value is purely derived from persisted fields and must appear on both `POST` (create) and `GET` responses \u2014 and `GET` loads the owner straight from the repository without running the create pipeline's assign steps. The mapper covers both paths with no new DB column or function class.\n\nTests: `Cp15Tests` (both SILVER/BRONZE cases) and the full suite (25 tests) pass.",
